  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OASIS: Onward Alliance for Stability and Inclusive Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project builds on previous effort started as part of the &#xbf;New Generation of Public Leaders in Yemen&#xbf; project which was implemented between April 2020 and February 2022. The project adopts two of the pillars of the EU approach to the Youth Action Plan: (i) The &#xbf;partnership to engage&#xbf; pillar, and (ii) the &#xbf;partnership to connect&#xbf; pillar by fostering opportunities for young Yemenis to network and exchange with their peers from the GCC and the wider region.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
